|-
| MWEB Stealth Offset || <tt>PSBT_GLOBAL_MWEB_TX_STEALTH_OFFSET = 0x91</tt> || None || 32-byte stealth-offset blinding factor || 2 || 0 || 2
|-
| MWEB Kernel Count || <tt>PSBT_GLOBAL_MWEB_KERNEL_COUNT = 0x92</tt> || None || <compact-size> number of kernel maps present || 2 || 0 || 2
